f5735aa7349b553c04739f3605879b9e32f5275f9216c8abab1fa8af5ce2a7fe0e275d349ab827c598fd10ba85ee2a5878225dfa67148fc312cef30956e00bdb  use-vi-as-default-editor.patch
"

